  "instance_name": "wife_look_stereotype",
  "label": "Wife Look Stereotype",
  "description": "A cultural trope depicting a spouse (often a wife) giving a calm, disapproving, or judgmental look to a partner upon their return home, especially after a day of work or problematic behavior. This stereotype is used in the meme to contrast the mundane 'return home' with the horrific act of suicide bombing, creating dark humor. It relies on real-world social dynamics and gendered expectations.",
